            "created_at": "2025-07-25T22:33:43.975855+00:00",
            "notes": "Get [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c) power as it not only increases the healing to your team, but when combined with [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c), will give you 35% lifesteal as well. This power is essential to staying alive during melee combat. \n\nBuy [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) item as it speeds up your projectiles and enhances your lethality. This item will allow you to get kills from long ranges and help you earn more cash.\n\nYou can also consider getting survival items if you are taking too much damage or dying too often.",
