            "notes": "For your last power, pick [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44), as it will give you the extra bit of mobility to close the gap to the enemy team. If you really need additional mobility, replace [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) with [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48), which combines with [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) ability to give more attack/movement speed.\n\nYou should also get [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) as it synergizes strongly with [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) to further improve your survivability.\n\nIf you have enough cash, consider replace [Keepsake of Chaos](item_5f5c7c4c-a559-43a0-9794-bdb866d2327e) with another epic item.\n\n- If the enemy tank is giving you trouble, buy [Volskaya Ordnance](item_396c0970-daa8-47e3-8049-e65f03fe5cec) for the extra damage to high HP enemies. \n\n- For more damage output overall, get [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48)/[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) if you don't have it already.\n\n- For more survivability, take [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) for overhealth when ult is used or [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) for burst damage reduction.",
